# Real OECD ICIO release files (e.g. 2022_SML.csv) -- too large to commit,
# not included in this package; download your own copy (see README.md's
# "Getting the real data into your own copy") and drop it in this
# directory. Year-prefixed so the small committed elasticity CSVs
# (fontagne_icio_trade_elast.csv, combined_trade_elast.csv) are unaffected.
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]*.csv
